{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\*\\*\\*\\<Eternally Regressing Knight>\\*\\*\\*, \\*\\*\\*\\<The Greatest Estate Developer>\\*\\*\\*,  dan masih banyak lagi!\n\n&#x20;\n\nSetelah dua belas tahun menderita mimpi buruk yang tak dapat dijelaskan, Woojin\n\nmengalami kematian yang tak terduga...\n\n&#x20;\n\nIa terbangun di dunia mimpi buruk, \"Magic Realm.\"\n\n&#x20;\n\nMenggunakan keahliannya yang diasah untuk memburu binatang buas iblis, Woojin menjadi lebih kuat,\n\ndan memulai kehidupan baru sebagai pemburu binatang buas iblis.\n\n&#x20;\n\nDunia fantasi gelap ini, di mana semakin banyak berburu, akan semakin kuat.&#x20;\n\nSebenarnya cukup menyenangkan.","alternative_title":"마수 사냥꾼이 살아가는 법","author":"Menyusul","artist":"JQCOMIX","chapters":[{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"ch_29","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"b4399906-fbc0-44d5-908c-d69e18bb9265","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_854d243b-a912-4ce6-9a48-507911b55085/chapter_ch_28/10.webp","h